<title>USA: Celebrity sets 1-for-50 reverse split.</title>
<headline>Celebrity sets 1-for-50 reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>PALM BEACH, Fla. 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Celebrity Entertainment Inc said on Wednesday that it underwent a one-for-50 reverse stock split at the close of business on Tuesday, March 11, 1997.</p>
<p>Common shares commenced trading on a post-reverse split basis Wednesday, March 12, 1997, the company said.  For the next 20 business days, the company symbol will be CLEBD, the company said.</p>
<p>As of March 11, 1997 there were 17,183,285 shares of common stock outstanding, Celebrity Entertainment said.</p>
